---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What this site collects: anonymous page views counted on our own server." currentNav="">
  <div class="page-fade site-frame">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="label"><div class="eyebrow">privacy</div></div>
      <div>
        <h1>Privacy</h1>
        <p class="lede">This is a personal blog. There are no accounts, no forms and no comments here.</p>
        <h2>Visit statistics</h2>
        <p>The site counts page views with its own small script: the page address, the referring host, and the browser's coarse language and platform (as any web request carries them). There are no cookies, no advertising identifiers and no Google Analytics: the counts are stored on our own Cloudflare account and answer one question — which texts are actually read.</p>
        <p>Nothing in those counts identifies you, and there is no banner to dismiss because there is no cookie to set.</p>
        <h2>If we work together</h2>
        <p>For consulting work I keep our correspondence and the billing details an invoice needs (name or company, address, tax ID). Correspondence is kept for up to 2 years after the last contact, billing details for as long as tax rules require. They are used only for the work and the invoice, never for marketing. See also the <a href="/terms/">terms</a>.</p>
        <h2>Hosting</h2>
        <p>The site is served by GitHub Pages behind Cloudflare; both see the technical data any web request carries, such as your IP address.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about your data: <a href="https://github.com/xronocode" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/xronocode</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  h2 { margin: 28px 0 8px; }
  p { margin: 0 0 12px; max-width: 62ch; }
  p a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
